<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107106" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκ-φέρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carry out a little,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεξέφερεν σάκος</span>
			<i>lifted</i> it <i>a little outwards,</i> so that Teucer could
			take shelter under it, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.268
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>carry out from under, carry off,</i> so as to be out of danger, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλον υἱὸν ὑπεξέφερεν πολέμοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.318
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυτθὸν γὰρ ὑπὲκ θανάτοιο φέρονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.628
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>carry away, bear onward,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέκφερον ὠκέες ἵπποι</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτούς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.496
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος ὑ. τὸν ἄνδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Luc.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόδες αὐτὸν ὑπέκφερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1264
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>eliminate insensibly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Ren.Ves.</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἡμέρης ὁδῷ</span>
			<i>get on before, have the start</i> by a day's journey, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.125
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>endure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lesb.Rh.
					2.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεξέφυγεν</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.202
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
